{"id":55774,"ord":1,"n_segments":127,"prev":55773,"next":55775,"doc":{"id":"68097","title":"68097_Freddie Green oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Freddie Green","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68097/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68097"},"chapter":"Charleston childhood","title":"His brothers Clarence and Josey","category":"family_childhood","summary":"He names his two younger brothers and says neither was musical; one works as a cook at the Charleston Navy Yard.","period":"1910s-1970s","year_from":1910,"year_to":1979,"words":161,"start":[1,13],"end":[2,20],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68097#s55774","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Charleston","focus":0,"type":"city"},{"name":"New York","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"Clarence","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Josey","qid":null,"n":2}],"story":{"theme":47,"theme_name":"Growing up and learning music: family, first instruments, teachers","community":117,"community_name":"Where I came from: parents, siblings and birth","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":1,"b":13,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"That's nice. How many in the family?"},{"p":1,"b":14,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Just me and a couple of brothers --"},{"p":1,"b":15,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Is that right?"},{"p":1,"b":16,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"-- Clarence and Josey."},{"p":1,"b":17,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Older?"},{"p":1,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No, they were younger."},{"p":1,"b":19,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"They were younger?"},{"p":2,"b":0,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. They were born you know there -- Clarence was there, who was born at a different time than I was, and I left and I went to New York. Then my mother got married and had my other brother."},{"p":2,"b":1,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah. So he was quite a bit younger than you?"},{"p":2,"b":2,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yes."},{"p":2,"b":3,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Well, why don't we just talk about that. Where are they now?"},{"p":2,"b":4,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Well, one of them is in Charleston."},{"p":2,"b":5,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Which one?"},{"p":2,"b":6,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Joe."},{"p":2,"b":7,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"And what does he do?"},{"p":2,"b":8,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"He's working for the Armed Services more or less, at the Navy Yard there."},{"p":2,"b":9,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Oh"},{"p":2,"b":10,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"He's a cook."},{"p":2,"b":11,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Do you see him when you go through?"},{"p":2,"b":12,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Oh, I usually go around and see him."},{"p":2,"b":13,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"You do? He's got family I guess?"},{"p":2,"b":14,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yes."},{"p":2,"b":15,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah"},{"p":2,"b":16,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":2,"b":17,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Was he musical?"},{"p":2,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No, not really."},{"p":2,"b":19,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Was Clarence?"},{"p":2,"b":20,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No."}]}